			"notes": "- **Add OneConfig**\nOneConfig is an upcoming mod/developer tool currently in the making, centered around User Experience, to compete with clients while remaining in the Forge/Fabric space. \n\nThe mission of OneConfig includes:\n- Unifying all mods interfaces into a simple, clean, theme-able UI.\n- Becoming the golden standard of user experience in the Minecraft client/modding scene.\n- Integrate mods together with automatic updates and a unified, usable, and very customizable HUD. \n\nTo find out more, join https://discord.gg/polyfrost.\n- Remove OneCore / Essential"
